WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.982
You are eating about half the protein you
think you are.

00:00:03.982 --> 00:00:09.173
I tracked mine honestly for a week and I
was forty grams short every day.

00:00:09.173 --> 00:00:17.636
The problem is that a chicken breast on a
label is a hundred and sixty five grams,
and the one on your plate is ninety.

00:00:17.636 --> 00:00:24.960
Weigh your food for three days. Not
forever. Three days is enough to
recalibrate your eyes permanently.
